    title: "Forge entry-script guards read FORGEJO_TOKEN/FORGEJO_USER directly instead of resolve_forge_token (C9), so a github-only .env hard-fails 8 pre-flight guards while the API layer underneath works"  # 8989
    status: violated  # 8989
    priority: 1  # 8989
    parent:  # 8989
